### GET request to example server
GET http://localhost:5001/api/ddd/orders/2
###

### gateway 获取订单详情
GET http://localhost:5000/orders/2
X-Client-Id: 123456
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..LA6VAxBxwdTuF-FX-FLVh67onQeg5xkboRBHYJ4lDP0



### 添加订单
POST http://localhost:5000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1001,
      "productName": "机械键盘",
      "unitPrice": 299.00,
      "currency": "CNY",
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "productId": 1002,
      "productName": "鼠标",
      "unitPrice": 99.00,
      "currency": "CNY",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}
###


### 获取 jwt token
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}
###




### jwt token 认证
GET http://localhost:5000/secure
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..S7xgV2rGXu3qNFIyDgTIlyJXEuUJFjuP3CNR8_9zMO4
###



# curl -i 
#  -H "X-Client-Id: client-a" 
#  http://localhost:5000/orders/2
GET http://localhost:5000/orders/2
X-Client-Id: client-a

